						<disappearAtTick>3849000</disappearAtTick>
						<text>A caveworld illuminator named (*Name)Kepler(/Name) is crashing in a transport pod nearby.

(*Name)Kepler(/Name) is suffering from paralytic abasia and will be unable to walk.

He will recover naturally after many days. There is also a chance of a lucky quick recovery. Paralytic abasia can also be cured by a special operation which requires a large amount of glitterworld medicine.

He is willing to contribute once he has recovered, but will not leave voluntarily. If you don't want (*Name)Kepler(/Name), you can banish him, sell him into slavery or leave him to die. However, your other colonists may find this disturbing.

(*Name)Kepler(/Name)'s best stat: Artistic (skill level 7)</text>
