								</lookTargets>
								<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
								<text>The mechanoid ship has crashlanded nearby.

It contains a working grav engine. The engine pushes against gravity and generates a lift field around itself, allowing it to levitate massive ships or platforms. While it does not work when far from a planet, it can be used to move across the planet and to reach orbit.

Inspect the engine to make use of it.</text>
								<quest>Quest_0</quest>
