				<li>
					<id>1</id>
					<name>The Hunted Knight</name>
					<appearanceTick>480000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceExpireTick>600000</acceptanceExpireTick>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>600000</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Eulogia Pascalpho&lt;/color&gt;, a knight of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Fallen Empire&lt;/color&gt; is calling from nearby. Her guards were killed in an ambush. She escaped, but is now being followed by (*Threat)a manhunting hare(/Threat).

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Pascalpho&lt;/color&gt; wants you to keep her safe at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Stonkley&lt;/color&gt; for a few hours until her shuttle can come pick her up.

She will bestow 8 honor on whoever accepts this quest. This is enough honor to receive the royal title of Novice, and all benefits that come with it - including the first level of psychic powers.</description>
					<root>Intro_Wimp</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
					<charity>True</charity>
					<parent>null</parent>
				</li>
				<li>
					<id>2</id>
					<name>Shelter for an Ally</name>
					<appearanceTick>637000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceExpireTick>890160</acceptanceExpireTick>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>890160</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Mike 'Anarchist' Mudgett&lt;/color&gt;, Holy Pope of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;Merchant's Cartel&lt;/color&gt; is requesting a favor. His friend &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Margarita Booker&lt;/color&gt; is interested in learning about other cultures, and he wants you to host her at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Stonkley&lt;/color&gt; for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;25 days&lt;/color&gt;. 

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Booker&lt;/color&gt; will not do any work.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Booker&lt;/color&gt; appreciates quality accommodation. You will gain goodwill with &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;Merchant's Cartel&lt;/color&gt; if you keep her average mood above 50%.</description>
					<root>Hospitality_Joiners</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
					<parent>null</parent>
				</li>
				<li>
					<id>3</id>
					<name>The Rescue of Midori</name>
					<appearanceTick>885000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>885000</acceptanceTick>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<ended>True</ended>
					<endOutcome>Fail</endOutcome>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>1365000</cleanupTick>
					<initiallyAccepted>True</initiallyAccepted>
					<challengeRating>2</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Olisze&lt;/color&gt;, High Stellarch of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Fallen Empire&lt;/color&gt;, says that her friend has been wounded while traveling. The victim is &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Midori&lt;/color&gt;, a 49-year-old sheriff.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Olisze&lt;/color&gt; has nobody to spare to rescue &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Midori&lt;/color&gt;, but says that if you can make it to &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Midori&lt;/color&gt;'s position and rescue her, she will join you.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Olisze&lt;/color&gt; says that there may be an &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;unknown threat&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
					<root>OpportunitySite_DownedRefugee</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
					<parent>null</parent>
				</li>
				<li>
					<id>4</id>
					<name>Ship to the Stars</name>
					<appearanceTick>1200000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>1200000</acceptanceTick>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<initiallyAccepted>True</initiallyAccepted>
					<challengeRating>4</challengeRating>
					<description>A friendly AI from your past named (*Name)Charlon Whitestone(/Name) has sent you a message!

He reveals that he has a starship hidden on this planet, and sends you its world coordinates.

The starship is in deep hibernation mode. You'll have to start it up when you arrive, then defend it from raiders trying to steal it until the startup sequence completes. It will be a long, difficult series of battles.

If you can get the ship off the ground, (*Name)Charlon Whitestone(/Name) will take you off this rimworld, to the stars.</description>
					<root>EndGame_ShipEscape</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
