					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Mike 'Anarchist' Mudgett&lt;/color&gt;, Holy Pope of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;Merchant's Cartel&lt;/color&gt; is requesting a favor. His friend &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Zack Silva&lt;/color&gt; is interested in learning about other cultures, and he wants you to host him at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Stonkley&lt;/color&gt; for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;19 days&lt;/color&gt;. 

