					<cleanupTick>3475613</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>-1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Romele&lt;/color&gt; is approaching with a child in tow. They say they escaped from a slave caravan. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Romele&lt;/color&gt; begs you for permission to stay at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Stonkley&lt;/color&gt; for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;10 days&lt;/color&gt; so they can rest and regroup.

In return, they offer to work and fight for free during that time.

If you make them happy, some of them may offer to join you. They may also reward you later for helping them - but there is no way to know their true intentions.

These refugees are not part of any faction. If you wish, you can choose to kill, arrest, sell, or harvest them, without diplomatic consequences.</description>
