						<name>Nuchadean Lair</name>
						<adjective>Hemo-Samkhyan</adjective>
						<memberName>Hemo-Samkhyan</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Sacred Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Sacred Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Aditi&lt;/color&gt; raped and murdered and stole, and a great guilt was upon her, and in her selfishness she cast this guilt upon her chosen people, and all were filthy with it. The unclean, tattooed, pierced, and modified were cast into the ocean by &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Aditi&lt;/color&gt;. The God of Morality &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Aditi&lt;/color&gt; gave to her chosen followers the gift of red hunger, so that they might know true strength.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% raped and murdered and stole, and a great guilt was upon %%deity0_objective%%, and in %%deity0_possessive%% selfishness %%deity0_pronoun%% cast this guilt upon %%deity0_possessive%% chosen people, and all were filthy with it. The unclean, tattooed, pierced, and modified were cast into the ocean by %%deity0_name%%. The %%deity0_type%% %%deity0_name%% gave to %%deity0_possessive%% chosen followers the gift of red hunger, so that they might know true strength.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
						<iconDef>TripleCross</iconDef>
						<colorDef>LightPurple</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.470, 0.939, 0.495, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_OriginHindu</li>
							<li>Guilty</li>
							<li>FleshPurity</li>
							<li>Bloodfeeding</li>
						</memes>
