						<leaderTitleMale>Full Thug</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Full Thug</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"The prey people can teach you things even as they die under your knife. One old lady taught me that we've long since proven that we have the strength to rightfully rule this universe. It is as if that is etched directly into my mind."

  - Carlos Rubio, on his deathbed</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"The prey people can teach you things even as they die under your knife. One old lady taught me that we've long since proven that we have the strength to rightfully rule this universe. It is as if that is etched directly into my mind."

